{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120871","id":3981590125,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7tUj5t","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120871","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120871.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120871.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120871","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120871/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120871/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120871/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/014dd6b7c22dfe0414ceb3ff4b8054e3284fb207","number":120871,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add mute toggle to AudioStreamPlayers","user":{"login":"Akosmo","id":95504962,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFKQg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504962?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo","html_url":"https://github.com/Akosmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n## Important note\r\nThis PR is a draft because we haven't reached a conclusion on how button to the scene tree should be added for this.\r\nHere's a simpler PR that just adds the methods: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120894\r\n\r\n### Overview\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2037\r\n\r\nThis PR introduces mute toggles that can be accessed via an AudioStreamPlayer's inspector, and the scene tree.\r\nWhile -80 dB (minimum volume in the inspector slider) is not really audible, the only way to truly mute audio is to either set linear volume to 0 (-INF dB, both unavailable to the editor) or muting in the bus. Adjusting the slider or muting in the bus are not desirable in every case, since one could just want to mute one or multiple players, and easily return to the previous levels.\r\n\r\n\r\n<img width=\"287\" height=\"287\" alt=\"mute_players_img_1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b0b44da-c859-47fd-bb09-6fe40c1b5172\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88fe6c2b-b321-499e-a231-6ce25b844df1\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Limitations\r\n- Mute only works for the Stream playback type\r\n\r\nI'm not comfortable editing code related to the Sample playback type. A little too much. I suggest someone to try adding that. This limitation is mentioned in the documentation.\r\n\r\n- Mute only works in the regular/local scene tree\r\n\r\nThe toggle is not available in the remote tree. There was an attempt, but wasn't working properly. Again, I suggest someone to try adding that eventually, since it could be useful.\r\n\r\n### Notes for reviewers\r\nIn general, despite a few of my small contributions in this repository (mostly related to audio), I'm not a very experienced programmer. This is my first time modifying the AudioServer. Would appreciate someone checking that.\r\nI'm also not super experienced with the editor code. Most of it was copied from code related to the visibility button, but modified a bit so it'd make sense.\r\n\r\nI've tested the changes, and things seem to work on my end.\r\n\r\nIf a new button in the scene tree really is too much, I could make an alternative PR that just adds the mute property to AudioStreamPlayers, but then the proposal wouldn't be closed.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","c